  "instructions": [
    "Bring the vegetable broth to a boil in a large pot.",
    "Add the Ramen noodles to the pot and cook for 3 minutes.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the tandoor spice mix and sesame oil.",
    "Add the sliced mushrooms and chopped bok choy to the pot and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the shredded gruyere cheese until melted and smooth.",
    "Add the cooked noodles to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped green onions."
